# Paths that either execute with deploy credentials (workflows, runner scripts, the nightly
# jobs) or define what gets deployed (the image, its context, the guard scripts, the lockfile).
# A change here needs a maintainer's review before it can merge — enforced by the main branch
# ruleset's "require review from code owners", which reads this file.
#
# Membership lives in the org team, not here: add or remove people at
# https://github.com/orgs/The-RFP-Hub/teams/maintainers. The team needs write access on this
# repository for GitHub to honour it as an owner.
.github/**       @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
Dockerfile       @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
.dockerignore    @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
scripts/**       @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
pnpm-lock.yaml   @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
